	Michaelis, Rune; Hass, H Christian; Mielck, Finn; Papenmeier, Svenja; Sander, Lasse; Gutow, Lars; Wiltshire, Karen Helen (2019): Epibenthic assemblages of hard-substrate habitats in the German Bight (south-eastern North Sea) described using drift videos. Continental Shelf Research, 175, 30-41, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.csr.2019.01.011
	Papenmeier, Svenja; Hass, H Christian (2018): Detection of stones in marine habitats combining simultaneous hydroacoustic surveys. Geosciences, 8(8), 279, https://doi.org/10.3390/geosciences8080279
